								Availability was last updated. This is a read-only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element></xsd:sequence></xsd:complexType><xsd:complexType name="EntityType"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>A collection of business entities.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation><xsd:sequence><xsd:element name="AlternateLanguageEntityDescription" type="p0:AlternateLanguageEntityDescriptionType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>A collection of alternate language entity
