								Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DriverControlEnumVal" type="p0:DriverControlEnumValType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The driver control. Not applicable to trailer
								equipment types.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DriverControlEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for DriverControlEnumVal. Read-only.
								Available only through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="EquipmentCategoryEnumVal" type="p0:EquipmentCategoryEnumValType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The equipment category.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="EquipmentCategoryEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for EquipmentCategoryEnumVal. Read-only.
								Available only through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="FEUFactor" type="p0:UnitDivideFactorType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The FEU (Forty Foot Equivalent Unit) factor.
								Optional. Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="LastRollHeightClearance" type="p0:DimensionType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The clearance required for cylinders that are loaded
								as rolls at the end of the equipment. Optional. Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="LastStackHeightClearance" type="p0:DimensionType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The clearance required for cylinders that are loaded
								as stacks at the end of the equipment. Optional. Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="StackLoadingOnRightFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Indicates whether cylinders should start loading on
								the right side of the equipment. Optional. Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="LoadConfiguratorEquipmentTypeEnumVal" type="p0:LoadConfiguratorEnumValType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Indicates whether this equipment type is used for
								full loading or pallet building.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="LoadConfiguratorEquipmentTypeEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for
								LoadConfiguratorEquipmentTypeEnumVal. Read-only. Available only
								through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CreatedDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The date and time that the Equipment Type was
								created. This is a read-only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="UpdatedDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The date and time that the Equipment Type was
								updated. This is a read-only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CreatedByUserCode" type="p0:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The ID of the user who created the Equipment Type.
								This is a read-only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="UpdatedByUserCode" type="p0:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The ID of the user who updated the Equipment Type.
								This is a read-only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="UnitOfMeasure" type="p0:UnitOfMeasureType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The unit of measurement for the equipment type. The
								field is obsolete.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="IgnoreVariableLoadUnloadTimeFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[Indicates whether the contents of
								VariableLoadingUnloadingTime should be ignored. Defaults to true if
								not specified. May be present for add and change operations.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="VariableLoadingUnloadingTime" type="p0:VariableLoadingUnloadingTimeType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Variable loading or unloading time factor. Optional.
								Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="IgnoreEquipmentCommodityExclusionFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[Indicates whether the contents of
								EquipmentCommodityExclusion should be ignored. Defaults to true if
								not specified. May be present for add and change operations.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="EquipmentCommodityExclusion" type="p0:EquipmentCommodityExclusionType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Equipment Commodity Exclusion. Optional. Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="IgnoreEquipmentAssociation" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[Indicates whether the contents of
								EquipmentAssociation should be ignored. Defaults to true if not
								specified. May be present for add and change operations.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="EquipmentAssociation" type="p0:EquipmentAssociationType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The equipment association representing an associated
								trailer equipment type. Applicable only to tractor equipment types.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="IgnoreEquipmentAxleFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[Indicates whether the contents of EquipmentAxle
								should be ignored. Defaults to true if not specified. May be present
								for add and change operations.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="EquipmentAxle" type="p0:EquipmentAxleType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The equipment axle. Sequence of equipment axles is
								determined by order of input data.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element></xsd:sequence></xsd:complexType><xsd:complexType name="EquipmentTypeCrossReferenceType"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>An equipment type cross-reference.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation><xsd:sequence><xsd:element name="ExternalCode" type="p0:ExternalXRefType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The external ID code. Mandatory. May not be empty.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="EquipmentTypeCode" type="p0:EquipmentCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The equipment type code. Optional.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element></xsd:sequence></xsd:complexType><xsd:complexType name="EventReasonType"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>An event reason associated with events that occur in
						Transportation Manager.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation><xsd:sequence><xsd:element name="Id" type="p0:IDType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Internal ID. Applicable only for UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="EventReasonCode" type="p0:EventCodeType"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The event reason code. Mandatory. Not updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="EventDescription" type="p0:NameType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>A description of the Event Reason. Mandatory for a
								new Event Reason. Cannot be blank. Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ActiveFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Indicates whether the Event Reason is active or not.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ExternalCode1" type="p0:ExternalXRefType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>An external identifying code.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ExternalCode2" type="p0:ExternalXRefType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>A second external identifying code.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="SystemProvidedFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Indicates whether the Event Reason is system
								provided or not. This is a read-only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CreatedByUserCode" type="p0:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The ID of the user who created the Event Reason.
								This is a read-only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="UpdatedByUserCode" type="p0:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The ID of the user who updated the Event Reason.
								This is a read-only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CreatedDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The date and time that the Event Reason was created.
								This is a read-only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="UpdatedDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The date and time that the Event Reason was updated.
								This is a read-only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element></xsd:sequence></xsd:complexType><xsd:complexType name="ExchangeRateDataType"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>An exchange rate data entry for a combination of currency,
						exchange rate group and date range. By default, open date range is assumed.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation><xsd:sequence><xsd:element name="SystemCurrencyID" type="p0:UnsignedShortType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>A system-generated currency identifier. Either this
								field or CurrencyCode must be provided for an entry.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CurrencyCode" type="p0:CurrencyCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The currency code. Either this field or
								SystemCurrencyID must be provided to for an entry. Ignored if
								SystemCurrencyID is supplied.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ExchangeRateGroupCode" type="p0:ExchangeRateGroupCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The exchange rate group ID. Mandatory.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ExchangeRate" type="p0:ExchangeRateType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The exchange rate. Mandatory.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="EffectiveDate" type="xsd:date" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The effective date. If not specified, open effective
								date is assumed such that the exchange rate will apply to any date
								before and on the expiration date. Cannot be an empty element.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ExpirationDate" type="xsd:date" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The expiration date. If not specified, open
								expiration date is assumed such that the exchange rate will apply to
								any date on and after the effective date. Cannot be an empty
								element.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element></xsd:sequence></xsd:complexType><xsd:complexType name="ExchangeRateEntryType"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>An exchange rate entry for a combination of currency,
						exchange rate group and date range. By default, open date range is assumed.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation><xsd:sequence><xsd:element name="Id" type="p0:IDType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Internal ID. Applicable only for UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="SystemExchangeRateID" type="p0:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[A system-generated exchange rate identifier. Either
								this field or a combination of SystemCurrencyID or CurrencyCode,
								ExchangeRateGroupCode, EffectiveDate and ExpirationDate must be
								provided to identify an entry.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="SystemCurrencyID" type="p0:UnsignedShortType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[A system-generated currency identifier. Either
								SystemExchangeRateID or a combination of this field or CurrencyCode,
								ExchangeRateGroupCode, EffectiveDate and ExpirationDate must be
								provided to identify an entry. This field or CurrencyCode must be
								provided to create a new exchange rate entry.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CurrencyCode" type="p0:CurrencyCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The currency code. Either SystemExchangeRateID or a
								combination of SystemCurrencyID or this field,
								ExchangeRateGroupCode, EffectiveDate and ExpirationDate must be
								provided to identify an entry. SystemCurrencyID or this field must
								be provided to create a new exchange rate entry. Ignored if
								SystemCurrencyID is supplied.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ExchangeRateGroupCode" type="p0:ExchangeRateGroupCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The exchange rate group ID. Either
								SystemExchangeRateID or a combination of SystemCurrencyID or
								CurrencyCode, this field, EffectiveDate and ExpirationDate must be
								provided to identify an entry. Cannot be updated for an existing
								exchange rate entry. Mandatory for a new exchange rate entry.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ExchangeRate" type="p0:ExchangeRateType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The exchange rate. Updatable. Mandatory for a new
								exchange rate entry.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="EffectiveDate" type="xsd:date" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The effective date. If not specified, open effective
								date is assumed such that the exchange rate will apply to any date
								before and on the expiration date. Either SystemExchangeRateID or a
								combination of SystemCurrencyID or CurrencyCode,
								ExchangeRateGroupCode, this field and ExpirationDate must be
								provided to identify an entry. Cannot be changed for an existing
								exchange rate entry, NewEffectiveDate should be used for this
								purpose. Cannot be an empty element.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="NewEffectiveDate" type="xsd:date" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The new effective date for an existing exchange rate
								entry (change operation only). Optional. Cannot be an empty element.
								Not applicable for a new exchange rate entry.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="NewEffectiveDateActiveFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[Indicates whether the effective date should be
								changed to the value provided as NewEffectiveDate or left unchanged
								if effective date exists and NewEffectiveDate is not provided. If
								false and effective date exists, effective date will be cleared such
								that the exchange rate will apply to any date before and on the
								expiration date. Not applicable for a new exchange rate entry.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ExpirationDate" type="xsd:date" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The expiration date. If not specified, open
								expiration date is assumed such that the exchange rate will apply to
								any date on and after the effective date. Either
								SystemExchangeRateID or a combination of SystemCurrencyID or
								CurrencyCode, ExchangeRateGroupCode, EffectiveDate and this field
								must be provided to identify an entry. Cannot be changed for an
								existing exchange rate entry, NewExpirationDate should be used for
								this purpose. Cannot be an empty element.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="NewExpirationDate" type="xsd:date" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The new expiration date for an existing exchange
								rate entry (change operation only). Optional. Cannot be an empty
								element. Not applicable for a new exchange rate entry.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="NewExpirationDateActiveFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[Indicates whether the expiration date should be
								changed to the value provided as NewExpirationDate or left unchanged
								if expiration date exists and NewExpirationDate is not provided. If
								false and expiration date exists, expiration date will be cleared
								such that the exchange rate will apply to any date on and after the
								effective date. Not applicable for a new exchange rate entry.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CreatedDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The date and time when the exchange rate entry was
								created. Read-only.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="UpdatedDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The date and time when the exchange rate entry was
								updated. Read-only.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CreatedByUserCode" type="p0:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The ID of the user who created the exchange rate
								entry. Read-only.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="UpdatedByUserCode" type="p0:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The ID of the user who updated the exchange rate
								entry. Read-only.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element></xsd:sequence></xsd:complexType><xsd:complexType name="ExchangeRateGroupType"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>An exchange rate group used as a source for exchange rate
						information.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation><xsd:sequence><xsd:element name="Id" type="p0:IDType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Internal ID. Applicable only for UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ExchangeRateGroupCode" type="p0:ExchangeRateGroupCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The exchange rate group ID. Mandatory. Cannot be
								changed for an existing exchange rate group.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ExchangeRateGroupDescription" type="p0:NameType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>A description of the exchange rate group. Mandatory
								for creating an exchange rate group. Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ActiveFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Indicates whether the exchange rate group is active.
								Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="IsDefaultFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Indicates whether the exchange rate group is the
								default exchange rate group. Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CreatedDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The date and time when the exchange rate group was
								created. Read-only.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="UpdatedDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The date and time when the exchange rate group was
								updated. Read-only.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CreatedByUserCode" type="p0:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The ID of the user who created the exchange rate
								group. Read-only.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="UpdatedByUserCode" type="p0:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The ID of the user who updated the exchange rate
								group. Read-only.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="Memo" type="p0:MemoType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>A memo associated with the exchange rate group.
								Optional. Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element></xsd:sequence></xsd:complexType><xsd:complexType name="ExternalAliasStructureType"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>An external alias that a customer can use for a shipping
						location.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation><xsd:sequence><xsd:element name="Id" type="p0:IDType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Internal ID. Applicable only for UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ExternalLocationCode" type="p0:ShippingLocationCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The ID code of the external alias. Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ExternalLocationDescription" type="p0:NameType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>A description of the external location. Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ExternalLocationUsageFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Indicates whether a customer uses the external ID as
								a default. Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element></xsd:sequence></xsd:complexType><xsd:complexType name="GLAccountDesignationType"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[Record of a G/L Account Designation. Some of the input
						fields here are conditional mandatory or ignored depending on how the global
						settings are defined.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation><xsd:sequence><xsd:element name="Id" type="p0:IDType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Internal ID. Applicable only for UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="SystemGLAccountDesignationID" type="p0:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The system-generated ID for the G/L Account
								Designation record. Ignored for create. Mandatory otherwise.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="GLClassificationEnumVal" type="p0:GLClassEnumValType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The G/L Classification. Mandatory.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="GLClassificationEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for GLClassificationEnumVal. Read-only.
								Available only through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="GLTypeCode" type="p0:GLDomainValueType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The G/L Type. Mandatory.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="GLTypeCodeDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for GLTypeCode. Read-only. Available
								only through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ProfitCenterCode" type="p0:ProfitCenterDomainValueType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The profit center to which the customer revenue is
								assigned. Mandatory for G/L classification GLC_AR_ACCRUED_REVENUE,
								GLC_AR_ACCRUED_ASSET, GLC_AR_REVENUE and GLC_AR_ASSET.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ProfitCenterCodeDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for profitCenterCode. Read-only.
								Available only through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CostCenterCode" type="p0:CostCenterDomainValueType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The cost center to which the carrier expense is
								assigned. Mandatory for G/L classification
								GLC_AP_ACCRUED_EXPS_RVNU_SHPM, GLC_AP_ACCRUED_LBTY_RVNU_SHPM,
								GLC_AP_EXPS_RVNU_SHPM, GLC_AP_LBTY_RVNU_SHPM,
								GLC_AP_ACCRUED_EXPS_NON_RVNU_SHPM,
								GLC_AP_ACCRUED_LBTY_NON_RVNU_SHPM, GLC_AP_EXPS_NON_RVNU_SHPM and
								GLC_AP_LBTY_NON_RVNU_SHPM. The field will be Read only when G/L
								classification is for AR and the Revenue By Cost Center flag of
								Global Defaults is off]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CostCenterCodeDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for costCenterCode. Read-only. Available
								only through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="OriginLocationGLCategoryCode" type="p0:GLCategoryDomainValueType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The G/L category of the origin location. Conditional
								mandatory or read only depending on global setting.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="OriginLocationGLCategoryCodeDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for originLocationGLCategoryCode.
								Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DestinationLocationGLCategoryCode" type="p0:GLCategoryDomainValueType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The G/L category of the destination location.
								Conditional mandatory or read only depending on global setting.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DestinationLocationGLCategoryCodeDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for destinationLocationGLCategoryCode.
								Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="GLAccountNumber" type="p0:GLAccountNumberType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The G/L account number. Mandatory.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CreatedDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The date and time when the record was created. Read
								only.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="UpdatedDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The date and time when the record was updated. Read
								only.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DivisionCode" type="p0:DivisionCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The division ID. Mandatory.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="LogisticsGroupCode" type="p0:LogisticGroupCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The logistics group ID. Conditional mandatory or
								read only depending on global setting.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="OriginGLRegionZoneCode" type="p0:ZoneCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The original shipping location GL region zone ID.
								Conditional mandatory or read only depending on global setting.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DestinationGLRegionZoneCode" type="p0:ZoneCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The destination shipping location GL region zone ID.
								Conditional mandatory or read only depending on global setting.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CommodityCode" type="p0:CommodityCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The commodity ID. Conditional mandatory or read only
								depending on global setting.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CreatedByUserCode" type="p0:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The ID of the user who created this record. Read
								only.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="UpdatedByUserCode" type="p0:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The ID of the user who updated this record. Read
								only.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element></xsd:sequence></xsd:complexType><xsd:complexType name="HubType"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[A center for load consolidation or deconsolidation, also
						called a cross-dock or pool-point. Consolidation is the combining of several
						shipments into a single load or multiple loads. Deconsolidation is the
						separation of shipments that are grouped together in a load for delivery to
