								May be present for add and change operations.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="VariableLoadingUnloadingTime" type="p0:VariableLoadingUnloadingTimeType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Variable loading or unloading time factor. Optional.
								Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="IgnoreDockFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[Indicates whether the contents of Dock should be
								ignored. If false during change, all existing Dock members of this
								entity will be deleted and replaced with the contents of Dock.
								Defaults to true if not specified. May be present for add and change
								operations.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="Dock" type="p0:DockType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Docks of this Hub. Optional. Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="IgnoreEquipmentFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Indicates whether the collection of equipment
								elements should be ignored. May be present for add and change
								operations.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="Equipment" type="p0:ShippingLocationEquipmentType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[Supported equipment types for this hub. Contents
								will only be considered if the ignoreEquipmentFlag is false. May be
								present for add and change operations.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="IgnoreShipmentSplitRuleFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Indicates whether the collection of shipment split
								rules should be ignored. May be present for add and change
								operations.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ShipmentSplitRule" type="p0:ShipmentSplitRuleType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[Shipment split rules for this hub. Contents will
								only be considered if the ignoreShipmentSplitRuleFlag is false. May
								be present for add and change operations.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element></xsd:sequence></xsd:complexType><xsd:complexType name="HubStatusChangeInfoType"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>A collection of information for the Hub&apos;s status to change
						to.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation><xsd:sequence><xsd:element name="HubCode" type="p0:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>A collection of Hub codes. Mandatory.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="HubStatusEnumVal" type="p0:HubStatusEnumValType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The new status of the hub. Mandatory.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element></xsd:sequence></xsd:complexType><xsd:complexType name="INCOTermsType"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[INCO terms are a set of standard international freight terms
						defined by the International Chamber of Commerce. They bring consistency to
						the description of freight movements, and help eliminate uncertainty
						regarding which party is responsible for paying the cost of the freight
						movement, particularly for international shipments.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation><xsd:sequence><xsd:element name="Id" type="p0:IDType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Internal ID. Applicable only for UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="IncoTermsCode" type="p0:INCOTermsCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The INCO terms code. Mandatory. Not modifiable
								during update. INCO terms are identified by the combination of
								IncoTermsCode, IncoVersionEnumVal, and DivisionCode.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="IncoTermsDescription" type="p0:NameType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>A description of the INCO terms. Mandatory for
								create. Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="IncoVersionEnumVal" type="p0:INCOVersionEnumValType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The version of these INCO terms. Possible values are
								INCO_VERSION_NULL, INCO_VERSION_1990, INCO_VERSION_2000 and
								INCO_VERSION_2010. Mandatory. Not modifiable during update. INCO
								terms are identified by the combination of IncoTermsCode,
								IncoVersionEnumVal, and DivisionCode.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="IncoVersionEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for IncoVersionEnumVal. Read-only.
								Available only through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DivisionCode" type="p0:DivisionCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The division code. Mandatory. Not modifiable during
								update. INCO terms are identified by the combination of
								IncoTermsCode, IncoVersionEnumVal, and DivisionCode.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="IncoShippingLocationEnumVal" type="p0:INCOShippingLocationEnumValType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The INCO terms Shipping Location Source. Possible
								values are INCO_NULL, INCO_ORIGIN and INCO_DESTINATION. Optional.
								Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="IncoShippingLocationEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for incoShippingLocationEnumVal.
								Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DefaultIncoShippingLocationTypeEnumVal" type="p0:DefaultIncoShippingLocationTypeEnumValType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The Default Incoterms Shipping Location Type.
								Optional. Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DefaultIncoShippingLocationTypeEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for
								defaultIncoShippingLocationTypeEnumVal. Read-only. Available only
								through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CreatedDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The date and time that the INCO terms were created.
								Read only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="UpdatedDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The date and time that the INCO terms were updated.
								Read only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CreatedByUserCode" type="p0:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The ID of the user who created these INCO terms.
								Read only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="UpdatedByUserCode" type="p0:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The ID of the user who updated these INCO terms.
								Read only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element></xsd:sequence></xsd:complexType><xsd:complexType name="ItemGroupType"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Representation for a collection of Item Masters for a
						customer.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation><xsd:sequence><xsd:element name="Id" type="p0:IDType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Internal ID. Applicable only for UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ItemGroupCode" type="p0:ItemGroupCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The Item Group ID. Cannot be changed for an existing
								Item Group. Mandatory for all operations.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ItemGroupDescription" type="p0:NameType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>A description of the Item Group. Mandatory for
								create. Can always be changed during update. The value cannot be
								blank.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="NMFCRequiredFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[Indicates whether NMFC is required for Item Masters
								of this Item Group. Cannot be changed if Item Masters already exist
								for this Item Group.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="HarmonizedTariffRequiredFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[Indicates whether Harmonized Tariff is required for
								Item Masters of this Item Group. Cannot be changed if Item Masters
								already exist for this Item Group.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="UnitOfMeasure" type="p0:UnitOfMeasureType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The unit of measurement structure. Cannot be changed
								if Item Masters already exist for this Item Group.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CreatedDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The date and time that the Item Group was created.
								This is a read-only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="UpdatedDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The date and time that the Item Group was updated.
								This is a read-only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CreatedByUserCode" type="p0:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The ID of the user who created the Item Group. This
								is a read-only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="UpdatedByUserCode" type="p0:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The ID of the user who updated the Item Group. This
								is a read-only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ReferencedByCustomerFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Indicates whether this Item Group is referenced by a
								customer. This is a read-only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="Memo" type="p0:MemoType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>A memo associated with the Item Group. Optional. Can
								always be updated.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="IgnoreItemMastersFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Indicates whether the contents of ItemMaster should
								be ignored. This flag is not used for an existing Item Group.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ItemMaster" type="p0:ItemMasterType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Item Masters associated with the Item Group.
								Optional. Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element></xsd:sequence></xsd:complexType><xsd:complexType name="ItemLoadingFactorType"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[Item loading factor defines the minimum and maximum
						quantity, distance and transit time for a load having matched combination of
						Item Package Level, Equipment Type, Origin (if defined) and Destination (if
						defined) for a given loading type. If there are more than one matched, the
						one with the highest priority will be applicable.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation><xsd:sequence><xsd:element name="Id" type="p0:IDType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Internal ID. Applicable only for UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="SystemItemLoadingFactorID" type="p0:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The system-generated item loading factor ID.
								Read-only. Ignored for Create. For operations other than Create,
								mandatory unless full business key is specified. The business key
								consists of ItemType, LoadingTypeCode, EquipmentTypeCode,
								OriginZoneCode, DestinationZoneCode, ItemNumber and ItemGroup.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ItemType" type="p0:ItemDomainValueType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The item type used for this item loading factor. Not
								editable. Included into the business key. For operations other than
								Create, should not be specified if SystemItemLoadingFactorID is
								provided.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ItemTypeDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for ItemType. Read-only. Available only
								through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="LoadingTypeCode" type="p0:LoadingTypeCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[Loading type ID. Mandatory for Create. Not editable.
								Included into the business key. For operations other than Create,
								should not be specified if SystemItemLoadingFactorID is provided.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="EquipmentTypeCode" type="p0:EquipmentTypeCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The equipment type ID. Mandatory for Create. Not
								editable. Included into the business key. For operations other than
								Create, should not be specified if SystemItemLoadingFactorID is
								provided.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="OriginZoneCode" type="p0:ZoneCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The origin zone ID. Not editable. Included into the
								business key. For operations other than Create, should not be
								specified if SystemItemLoadingFactorID is provided. If the element
								is used to identify an item loading factor with empty origin zone
								ID, quoted space is expected.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DestinationZoneCode" type="p0:ZoneCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The destination zone ID. Not editable. Included into
								the business key. For operations other than Create, should not be
								specified if SystemItemLoadingFactorID is provided. If the element
								is used to identify an item loading factor with empty destination
								zone ID, quoted space is expected.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ItemNumber" type="p0:ItemNumberCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The Item Master ID. Not editable. Included into the
								business key. For operations other than Create, should not be
								specified if SystemItemLoadingFactorID is provided.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ItemGroupCode" type="p0:ItemGroupCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The Item Group ID. Not editable. Included into the
								business key. For operations other than Create, should not be
								specified if SystemItemLoadingFactorID is provided.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ItemPackageLevelIDCode" type="p0:ItemPackageLevelIDTypeDomainValueType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The item package level type ID. Mandatory on Create.
								System-defined values are '100' for 'Pallets', '200' for 'Layers'
								and '300' for 'Pieces'.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ItemPackageLevelIDCodeDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for ItemPackageLevelIDCode. Read-only.
								Available only through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ItemLoadingFactorStatusEnumVal" type="p0:ItemLoadingFactorStatusEnumValType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The item loading factor status.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ItemLoadingFactorStatusEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for ItemLoadingFactorStatusEnumVal.
								Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="Priority" type="p0:UnsignedLongType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Priority: the lower the number, the higher the
								priority.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="MaximumQuantity" type="p0:QuantityType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The maximum quantity.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="MaximumTransitTime" type="p0:HoursType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The maximum transit time.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="MaximumDistance" type="p0:DistanceType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The maximum distance.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="MinimumTransitTime" type="p0:HoursType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The minimum transit time.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="MinimumDistance" type="p0:DistanceType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The minimum distance.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CreatedByUserCode" type="p0:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The ID of the user who created this equipment
								capacity degradation. Read-only.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CreatedDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The date and time when this equipment capacity
								degradation was created. Read-only.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="UpdatedByUserCode" type="p0:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The ID of the user who most recently updated this
								equipment capacity degradation. Read-only.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="UpdatedDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The date and time when this equipment capacity
								degradation was most recently updated. Read-only.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element></xsd:sequence></xsd:complexType><xsd:complexType name="ItemMasterType"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>A template for creation of Shipment Items.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation><xsd:sequence><xsd:element name="Id" type="p0:IDType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Internal ID. Applicable only for UI-oriented APIs.
								The character ^ is used as a separator for the compound key.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ItemNumber" type="p0:ItemNumberCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The Item Master ID. Cannot be changed for an
								existing Item Master. Mandatory.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ItemGroupCode" type="p0:ItemGroupCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The Item Group ID. Cannot be changed for an existing
								Item Master. Mandatory.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ItemDescription" type="p0:ItemDescriptionType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>A description of the Item Master. Mandatory for a
								new Item Master. The value cannot be blank.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ItemType" type="p0:ItemDomainValueType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The item type used for this Item Master. Must be a
								valid domain table value if specified. Optional. Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ItemTypeDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for ItemType. Read-only. Available only
								through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="NominalWeight" type="p0:WeightType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The nominal weight. Mandatory for a new Item Master.
								Cannot be negative. Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="StatusEnumVal" type="p0:ItemMasterStatusEnumValType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The status of the Item Master. Cannot be an empty
								element. Optional. Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="StatusEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for statusEnumVal. Read-only. Available
								only through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="SerialLotControlEnumVal" type="p0:SerialLotControlEnumValType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The enumerated serial lot control number. Cannot be
								an empty element. Optional. Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="SerialLotControlEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for serialLotControlEnumVal. Read-only.
								Available only through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="NMFCCode" type="p0:NMFCCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The NMFC code. If NMFC is not required at the Item
								Group level, the value must be blank if this element is specified.
								If NMFC is required at the Item Group level, this element is
								mandatory for a new Item Master, the value cannot be blank.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="HarmonizedTariffCode" type="p0:HarmonizedTariffCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The harmonized tariff code. If harmonized tariff is
								required at the Item Group level, this element is mandatory for a
								new Item Master; the value cannot be blank.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="FreightClassCode" type="p0:FreightClassCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The freight class code. The value cannot be empty.
								Optional. Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="OriginCountryCode" type="p0:CountryCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The origin country code. Optional. Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CommodityCode" type="p0:CommodityCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The commodity code. The value cannot be empty.
								Optional. Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="Is3DLoadingRequiredFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Indicates whether 3D loading is required.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="Priority" type="p0:UnsignedShortType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Priority of this item master: the lower the number,
								the higher the priority.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ItemPackageLevelIDForPalletsCode" type="p0:ItemPackageLevelIDTypeDomainValueType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The item package level type ID 1. System-defined
								values are &apos;100&apos; for &apos;Pallets&apos;, &apos;200&apos; for &apos;Layers&apos; and &apos;300&apos; for
								&apos;Pieces&apos;.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ItemPackageLevelIDForPalletsCodeDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for ItemPackageLevelIDForPalletsCode.
								Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ItemPackageLevelIDForLayersCode" type="p0:ItemPackageLevelIDTypeDomainValueType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The item package level type ID 2. System-defined
								values are &apos;100&apos; for &apos;Pallets&apos;, &apos;200&apos; for &apos;Layers&apos; and &apos;300&apos; for
								&apos;Pieces&apos;.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ItemPackageLevelIDForLayersCodeDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for ItemPackageLevelIDForLayersCode.
								Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ItemPackageLevelIDForPiecesCode" type="p0:ItemPackageLevelIDTypeDomainValueType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The item package level type ID 3. System-defined
								values are &apos;100&apos; for &apos;Pallets&apos;, &apos;200&apos; for &apos;Layers&apos; and &apos;300&apos; for
								&apos;Pieces&apos;.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ItemPackageLevelIDForPiecesCodeDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for ItemPackageLevelIDForPiecesCode.
								Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DefaultItemPackageLevelIDCode" type="p0:ItemPackageLevelIDTypeDomainValueType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The default item package level type ID.
								System-defined values are &apos;100&apos; for &apos;Pallets&apos;, &apos;200&apos; for &apos;Layers&apos;
								and &apos;300&apos; for &apos;Pieces&apos;.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DefaultItemPackageLevelIDCodeDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for DefaultItemPackageLevelIDCode.
								Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="Memo" type="p0:MemoType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>A memo associated with the Item Master. Optional.
								Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CreatedDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The date and time that the Item Master was created.
								This is a read-only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="UpdatedDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The date and time that the Item Master was updated.
								This is a read-only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CreatedByUserCode" type="p0:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The ID of the user who created the Item Master. This
								is a read-only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="UpdatedByUserCode" type="p0:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The ID of the user who updated the Item Master. This
								is a read-only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element></xsd:sequence></xsd:complexType><xsd:complexType name="ItemPackageLevelType"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[Item Package Level is used to to define product dimensions
						and will be used as appropriate to pack shipments into loading spaces of an
						equipment type.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation><xsd:sequence><xsd:element name="Id" type="p0:IDType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Internal ID. Applicable only for UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="SystemItemPackageLevelID" type="p0:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The system-generated item package level ID.
								Read-only. Ignored for Create. For operations other than Create,
								mandatory unless full business key is specified. The business key
								consists of ItemPackageLevelIDCode, ItemNumber and ItemGroup.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ItemPackageLevelIDCode" type="p0:ItemPackageLevelIDTypeDomainValueType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The item package level type ID. Not editable.
								Included into the business key. For operations other than Create,
								should not be specified if SystemItemPackageLevelID is provided.
								System-defined values are '100' for 'Pallets', '200' for 'Layers'
								and '300' for 'Pieces'.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ItemPackageLevelIDCodeDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for ItemPackageLevelIDCode. Read-only.
								Available only through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ItemNumber" type="p0:ItemNumberCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The Item Master ID. Not editable. Included into the
