								throughput group. Read only.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ShippingLocationTypeEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for ShippingLocationTypeEnumVal.
