								capacity system identifier. Ignored for create; mandatory otherwise.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="SystemLocationThroughputGroupID" type="p0:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The location throughput group system identifier.
