								Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="StartDate" type="xsd:date" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The start date for this location throughput group
