								not specified, the start date and end date must be equal.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="EndDate" type="xsd:date" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The end date for the location throughput group
