								capacity was created. Read only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CreatedByUserCode" type="p0:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The ID of the user who created the location
