								Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ShipmentAttributeEnumVal" type="p0:LoadUnitEnumValType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Shipment attribute of this split rule. Manadatory.
