								it is committed.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element></xsd:sequence></xsd:complexType><xsd:complexType name="ShippingLocationStatusChangeInfoType"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[A collection of information for the shipping location's
