								shipping location with the specified code should exist.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ShippingLocationCode" type="p0:ShippingLocationCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>A shipping location code. Mandatory if
								systemShippingLocationID is not specified.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ShippingLocationStatusEnumVal" type="p0:ShippingLocationStatusEnumValType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The new status of the shipping location. Mandatory.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element></xsd:sequence></xsd:complexType><xsd:complexType name="ShippingLocationType"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>A shipping location.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation><xsd:sequence><xsd:element name="Id" type="p0:IDType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Internal ID. Applicable only for UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="SystemShippingLocationID" type="p0:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The system generated numerical Shipping Location ID.
