								UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="WarehouseManagementSystemInstanceCode" type="p0:WarehouseManagementSystemInstanceCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The WMS Instance ID.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="OriginMaximumNumberShipmentSplit" type="p0:UnsignedShortType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Maximum number of shipment splits for origin
