								carrier drop-off and the time when post-discharge starts. Not
								applicable for Load-Ats.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CreatedDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The date and time when the shipping location was
								created. Read-only.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="UpdatedDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The date and time when the shipping was updated.
								Read-only.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CreatedByUserCode" type="p0:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The ID of the user who created the shipping
								location. Read-only.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="UpdatedByUserCode" type="p0:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The ID of the user who updated the shipping
								location. Read-only.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DTTEOverrideEnumVal" type="p0:DTTEOverrideEnumValType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Indicates whether to convert or delete the distance
