								Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="Address" type="p0:AddressType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The address of the shipping location. Mandatory for
								Create. Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="Contact" type="p0:ContactType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The contact information for the shipping location.
								Optional. Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="BusinessHours" type="p0:BusinessHoursType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The business hours for the shipping location.
								Optional. Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="Memo" type="p0:MemoType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>A memo associated with the shipping location.
								Optional. Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="Directions" type="p0:MemoType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Directions to the shipping location.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="TransferOnlyFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Indicates whether the location is a transfer only
								hub. Optional. Updatable. Applicable only for hubs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="IgnoreContactsFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[Indicates whether the contents of ContactPerson
