								with the contents of ContactPerson. Defaults to true if not
								specified. May be present for add and change operations.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ContactPerson" type="p0:ContactPersonType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Contacts associated with the shipping location.
								Optional. Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="IgnoreAutoAppliedOptionsFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[Indicates whether the contents of the
								autoAppliedOption should be ignored. If false during change, all
								existing AutoAppliedOption members of this entity will be deleted
								and replaced with the contents of AutoAppliedOption. Defaults to
								true if not specified. May be present for add and change operations.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="AutoAppliedOption" type="p0:AutoAppliedOptionType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The auto-applied options for the shipping location.
								Optional. Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="IgnoreCustomerShippingLocationCrossReferenceFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[Indicates whether the contents of
								CustomerShippingLocationCrossReference should be ignored. If false
