								members of this entity will be deleted and replaced with the
								contents of CustomerShippingLocationCrossReference. Defaults to true
								if not specified. May be present for add and change operations.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CustomerShippingLocationCrossReference" type="p0:CustomerShippingLocationCrossReferenceType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The cross-reference relationship for a customer and
								shipping location. Optional. Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="IgnoreVariableLoadUnloadTimeFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[Indicates whether the contents of
								VariableLoadingUnloadingTime should be ignored. If false during
