								VariableLoadingUnloadingTime. Defaults to true if not specified. May
								be present for add and change operations.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="VariableLoadingUnloadingTime" type="p0:VariableLoadingUnloadingTimeType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Variable loading or unloading time factor. Optional.
								Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="IgnoreDockFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[Indicates whether the contents of Dock should be
