								operations.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="Dock" type="p0:DockType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Docks of this shipping location. Optional.
