								Ui-oriented APIs.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="AssociatedZone" type="p0:ShippingLocationZoneType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Zone associated with this shipping location.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="IgnoreShipmentSplitRuleFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Indicates whether the collection of shipment split
