								LatestServiceTime and LatestElapsedDays are supplied for a new
								Skeleton Location or changed for an existing Skeleton Location or a
								source version of a Skeleton Location. Should be set to false to
								clear LatestServiceTime and LatestElapsedDays.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="LatestServiceTime" type="xsd:time" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Indicates the latest time of day to service this
