								MustStartByTime and LatestElapsedDays.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="MustStartByTime" type="xsd:time" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Indicates the time of day cutoff for when service at
