								date/time of a skeleton load to mark the cutoff for when service at
								a skeleton stop must start. Mandatory if MustStartByTime is
								supplied.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="StopsBeforeFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Indicates if a stop can be inserted before this
