								processed using skeleton location IDs from the source skeleton route
								version; in this case, skeleton location IDs can be omitted for all
								skeleton locations in order to re-create all skeleton locations from
								the input.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CreatedDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The date and time when the entry was created. This
								is a read-only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="UpdatedDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The date and time when the entry was updated. This
								is a read-only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CreatedByUserCode" type="p0:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The ID of the user who created the entry. This is a
								read-only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="UpdatedByUserCode" type="p0:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The ID of the user who updated the entry. This is a
								read-only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element></xsd:sequence></xsd:complexType><xsd:complexType name="UserType"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>A person who is using this system. Mandatory field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation><xsd:sequence><xsd:element name="Id" type="p0:IDType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Internal ID. Applicable only for UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="UserCode" type="p0:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The ID code of the user. Mandatory for create. Not
								updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="UserName" type="p0:NameType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The name of the user. Mandatory for create.
								Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="LanguageCode" type="p0:LanguageDomainValueType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The language. Mandatory for Create. Updatable. If
								UseCountryLanguageForDefaultsFlag is true or omitted, the input
								value will be assigned to the user as default value for other
								entities. If UseCountryLanguageForLocaleFlag is true or omitted and
								CountryCode is supplied as well, the input value will be used to
								configure user locale. The output value is the value assigned to the
								user as default value for other entities.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="LanguageCodeDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for languageCode. Read-only. Available
								only through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ShipmentConsolidationClassCode" type="p0:ConsolidationClassType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The default shipment consolidation class. Optional.
								Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="FullAddressCheckEnumVal" type="p0:FullAddressCheckEnumValType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The address validation mode. The full set of
								validation modes instead of only POSTAL and STREET. Optional.
								Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="FullAddressCheckEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for fullAddressCheckEnumVal. Read-only.
								Available only through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DisallowRateShopFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Controls whether the user has restricted capability
