								variable time factor in terms of hundred weight, rather than raw
								weight). Optional. Updatable.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="VariableTimeFactorVal" type="p0:PreciseHoursType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The variable time factor defined by this entry.
								Optional. Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="LoadingTypeCode" type="p0:LoadingTypeCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The loading type of this record. Optional.
								Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ItemType" type="p0:ItemDomainValueType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The item type used for this record. Optional.
								Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ItemTypeDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for ItemType. Read-only. Available only
								through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CreatedByUserCode" type="p0:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The date and time that the shipment was created.
								Read-only.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="UpdatedByUserCode" type="p0:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The date and time that the shipment was last
								updated. Read-only.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CreatedDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The ID of the user who created the shipment.
								Read-only.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="UpdatedDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The ID of the user who last updated the shipment.
								Read-only.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element></xsd:sequence></xsd:complexType><xsd:complexType name="ZoneType"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[A geographic area that represents the origin or destination
						point of a shipment. Examples include a country, a state, a city, and a zip
						code range.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation><xsd:sequence><xsd:element name="Id" type="p0:IDType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Internal ID. Applicable only for UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ZoneCode" type="p0:ZoneCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The zone ID. Can not be blank. Can not be modified
								during update. Mandatory for all operations.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ZoneDescription" type="p0:NameType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>A description of the zone. Mandatory during create.
								Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ShortDescription" type="p0:ShortDescriptionType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>A short description of the zone. Optional.
								Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CountryCode" type="p0:CountryCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The country ID for the zone. Can not be blank.
								Mandatory and updatable..</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="State" type="p0:StateCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The state or province ID for the zone. *ALL means
								any state or province in the country of this zone. Optional.
								Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="GLRegionZoneGroupCode" type="p0:ZoneGroupCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The G/L region zone group of the zone. Optional.
