								Updatable. To force this value to be blank, enter a single space in
								double quotes.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="BusinessHourZoneGroupCode" type="p0:ZoneGroupCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The business hour zone group of the zone. Optional.
								Updatable. To force this value to be blank, enter a single space in
								double quotes.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="TimeZoneOffset" type="p0:TimezoneOffsetType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The number of hours offset from the default business
