								daylight savings time. Optional. Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="IsTimeZoneFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Indicates whether zone is a time zone. Optional. Can
