								Optional. Can not be modified during update.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DivisionCode" type="p0:DivisionCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The division ID. Not applicable for time zones,
