								should be ignored. Cannot be true for a new Zone.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="GeographicArea" type="p0:GeographicAreaType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The details of the geographic area of the zone.
								Mandatory. Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element></xsd:sequence></xsd:complexType><xsd:complexType name="BusinessDaysType"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The BusinessDays structure represents Business Days</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation><xsd:sequence><xsd:element name="Id" type="p0:IDType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Internal ID. Applicable only for UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="BusinessDaysID" type="p0:BusinessDaysCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Business days code. Mandatory for a new
