								Mandatory for a new BusinessDays. Cannot be blank.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="BusinessDaysSaturdayFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Indicates whether Saturday is a business day.
								Mandatory for a new BusinessDays. Cannot be blank.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="BusinessDaysSundayFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Indicates whether Sunday is a business day.
								Mandatory for a new BusinessDays. Cannot be blank.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CreatedDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The date and time when the entry was created. This
								is a read-only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="UpdatedDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The date and time when the entry was updated. This
								is a read-only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CreatedByUserCode" type="p0:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The ID of the user who created the entry. This is a
								read-only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="UpdatedByUserCode" type="p0:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The ID of the user who updated the entry. This is a
								read-only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element></xsd:sequence></xsd:complexType><xsd:complexType name="DayWeekPntTimeTableType"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The DayWeekPntTimeTable structure represents a Timetable</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation><xsd:sequence><xsd:element name="Id" type="p0:IDType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Internal ID. Applicable only for UI-oriented APIs.
								The character ^ is used as a separator for the compound key.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DeliveryScheduleCode" type="p0:DeliveryScheduleCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The delivery schedule code. Mandatory for a new
