								DayWeekPntTimeTable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ItineraryTimeTableCode" type="p0:ItineraryTimetableCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The itinerary time table code. Mandatory for a new
