								DayWeekPntTimeTable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ItineraryTimeTableEntryCode" type="p0:ItineraryTimetableEntryCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The itinerary time table entry code. Should match
