								first and last point, otherwise cannot be less than one.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element></xsd:sequence></xsd:complexType><xsd:complexType name="DeliveryScheduleType"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The DeliverySchedule structure represents a Delivery
