								DeliveryScheduleLocationTypeEnumVal cannot be defined as Zone.
								Cannot be true when AllowMultipleItinerariesFlag is true.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="AllowMultipleItinerariesFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[Indicates whether linking of multiple delivery
