								When AllowMultipleItinerariesFlag is true, mandatory for Create and
								cannot be cleared on Update.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DefaultTransitModeEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for DefaultTransitModeEnumVal.
								Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CreatedByUserCode" type="p0:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The ID of the create user. This is a read-only
