								ignoreItinerariesFlag.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="IgnoreItnrTimeTableFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Indicates whether the supplied itinerary timetables
