								depends on the value of ignoreItnrTimeTableFlag.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="FixedPntTimeTables" type="p0:FixedPntTimeTableType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The collection of FixedPntTimeTable structures.
								Accessibe only via UI-orineted APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ElapsedPntTimeTables" type="p0:ElapsedPntTimeTableType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The collection of elapsed point time tables.
								Accessibe only via UI-orineted APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element></xsd:sequence></xsd:complexType><xsd:complexType name="DeliveryScheduleEntityType"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>A sequence of entity structures of the type of entity to be
						deleted, retrieved, or updated.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation><xsd:sequence><xsd:element name="Itinerary" type="p0:ItineraryType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The physical collection of components that moves
