								ElapsedPntTimeTable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ItineraryTimeTableCode" type="p0:ItineraryTimetableCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The itinerary time table code. Mandatory for a new
								ElapsedPntTimeTable. Cannot be changed for an existing
								ElapsedPntTimeTable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ItineraryTimeTableEntryCode" type="p0:ItineraryTimetableEntryCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The itinerary time table entry code. Should match
								the itinerary time table entry code of the itinerary time table
								entry if supplied for a new ElapsedPntTimeTable. Cannot be changed
								for an existing ElapsedPntTimeTable.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ItineraryToPointSequentialNumber" type="p0:UnsignedShortType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[Sequential number of itinerary destination point.
								Mandatory for a new ElapsedPntTimeTable. Cannot be changed for an
