								stops of the load. Optional.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ShippingLocationCode" type="p0:ShippingLocationCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The ID of the shipping point of the stop. Optional.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ShippingLocationTypeEnumVal" type="p0:ShipPointEnumValType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The type of shipping point for the stop. Optional.
								If not specified and shippingLocationCode is specified, one and only
								one shipping location with the specified code should exist.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ShippingLocationTypeEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for shippingLocationTypeEnumVal.
								Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="AppointmentDeleteFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Indicates whether the appointment is supposed to be
								deleted. Mandatory.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="Appointment" type="p0:AppointmentType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The appointment details. Optional.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element></xsd:sequence></xsd:complexType><xsd:complexType name="StopAppointmentEventType"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Details of the Stop appointment event - create only.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation><xsd:sequence><xsd:element name="SystemStopID" type="p0:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The stop ID of the appointment the event is for.
								Mandatory.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="EventReasonCode" type="p0:EventCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Event reason code for this appointment event.
