								allowed otherwise.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ShippingLocationTypeEnumVal" type="p0:ShipPointEnumValType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The shipping location type. If not specified and
								ShippingLocationCode is specified, one and only one shipping
								location with the specified code should exist.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="StopSequenceNumber" type="p0:UnsignedShortType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The stop sequence number. Mandatory if neither
								SystemStopID nor ShippingLocationCode is specified, not allowed
