								only SECCode and movementDateTime are used at this time.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element></xsd:sequence></xsd:complexType><xsd:complexType name="StopDockCommitmentType"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Details of the dock commitment.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation><xsd:sequence><xsd:element name="SystemDockCommitmentID" type="p0:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The system-generated dock commitment ID. Ignored for
