								IDs in the input.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element></xsd:sequence></xsd:complexType><xsd:complexType name="StopUpdateProgressDataType"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>An event that describes the progress of a stop.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation><xsd:sequence><xsd:element name="CarrierCode" type="p0:CarrierCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The carrier code. Required.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="SystemLoadID" type="p0:ExternalXRefType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The load ID or reference number. Optional.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="LoadDescription" type="p0:NameType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The load tracking number. Optional.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="MasterBillOfLadingNumber" type="p0:ExternalXRefType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The master BOL number. Optional.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ShippingLocationCode" type="p0:ShippingLocationCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The shipping location code. Optional.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ShippingLocationTypeEnumVal" type="p0:ShipPointEnumValType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The shipping location type. If not specified and
