								for the current route.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element></xsd:sequence></xsd:complexType><xsd:complexType name="TripCreateDataType"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Information about a created trip or booking.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation><xsd:sequence><xsd:element name="SystemLoadID" type="p0:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The IDs of the existing loads to be included into
