								booking. Not updatable for Tender Update operation, otherwise, can
								always be set and is always optional. When it is set and not for
								tender, it is used for validation only.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="TractorEquipmentTypeCode" type="p0:EquipmentCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The tractor equipment type. Can only be set during
								Tender. Not applicable for bookings.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DomicileCode" type="p0:DomicileCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The tractor domicile code. Can only be set during
								Tender. Not applicable for bookings.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="TenderAcceptedBy" type="p0:EmployeeNameType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The name of the employee who accepted the tender.
								Can be set during Tender (optional unless AutoAcceptControlEnumVal
								is set to AUTOACCEPTCTRL_TRUE) and Tender Accept(mandatory). For
								Tender Update, it will be used only when status is Tendered and
								AutoAcceptControlEnumVal is set to AUTOACCEPTCTRL_TRUE.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ActualCarrierService" type="p0:ExternalXRefType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The actual carrier and service for this tender, if
								using a virtual carrier such as NTE. Can only be set during Tender
								Accept and is optional then.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="Memo" type="p0:MemoType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>A memo for the trip. Can always be set and is always
