								Tender Reject, Tender Cancel or Tender Update and is optional then.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CarrierNotification" type="p0:TenderNotificationDataType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The carrier notification information. Can only be
								set during Tender, Tender Cancel or Tender Update and is optional
								then.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="RevisionToPreviouslyAcceptedFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Indicates if there was a revision to an accepted
								load tender. Can always be set and is always optional.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="TractorNumber" type="p0:TrailerNumberType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The tractor number. Can only be set during Tender,
								Tender Accept. Input only.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="TractorOwnerCarrierCode" type="p0:CarrierCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The carrier that owns the tractor. Can only be set
								during Tender, Tender Accept. Input only.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="TractorLicenseNumber" type="p0:LicenseNumberType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The tractor license number. Can only be set during
								Tender, Tender Accept. Input only.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DriverCode" type="p0:DriverIdType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The ID of the driver. Can only be set during Tender,
								Tender Accept. Input only.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DriverLicenseNumber" type="p0:LicenseNumberType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The license number of the driver. Can only be set
