								user input is required by Reference Number Qualifier setup.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="IgnoreReferenceNumbersFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[Indicates whether the contents of
								referenceNumberStructure (next) should be ignored. Applicable only
								for processTenderAccept operation.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ReferenceNumberStructure" type="p0:ReferenceNumberType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Reference numbers attached to the load. Optional.
								Applicable only for processTenderAccept operation.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="TripLoadTenderData" type="p0:TripLoadTenderDataType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The tender information for each load of the trip or
								booking. For tender retrieval, only those loads with operational
								status greater than planned status will be included.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element></xsd:sequence></xsd:complexType><xsd:complexType name="TripUpdateDataType"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Information about a trip or booking update.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation><xsd:sequence><xsd:element name="SystemTripID" type="p0:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The ID of the trip or booking.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CarrierCode" type="p0:CarrierCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The carrier code. Optional.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ServiceCode" type="p0:ServiceCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The service code. Optional.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="TractorEquipmentTypeCode" type="p0:EquipmentCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The tractor equipment type code. Optional. Not
								applicable for bookings.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DomicileCode" type="p0:DomicileCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The tractor domicile code associated with the trip.
								Optional. Not applicable for bookings.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CommodityCode" type="p0:CommodityCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The commodity code. Optional. Not applicable for
								bookings.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="SchedulingActiveFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[Indicates whether scheduling is active for the
								trip/booking (scheduling can be performed as part of a routing,
								rating and scheduling request).]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ShippingInstructionDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Shipping instruction date and time. Not applicable
								for trips.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ShippingInstructionDateTimeActiveFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Indicates whether ShippingInstructionDateTime is
								active.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ApplyResourceConstraintsFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[Indicates whether resource constraints such as
								equipment availability and lane constraints are applied. Optional.
								Not applicable for bookings.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="IncludeInResourceUsageCountFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Indicates whether associated resources will be
								included in resource usage counts. Optional. Not applicable for
								bookings.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ResourceProjectTypeCode" type="p0:ResourceProjectIDDomainValueType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The Resource Project ID. Not applicable for
								bookings.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="VesselDepartureDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Scheduled vessel departure date and time. Not
								applicable for trips.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="VesselArrivalDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Scheduled vessel arrival date and time. Not
								applicable for trips.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ContainerYardDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The date and time by which consignments must be
								ready at the container yard for loading onto the vessel. Not
								applicable for trips.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ContainerYardDateTimeActiveFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Indicates whether ContainerYardDateTime is active.
								Not applicable for trips.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="Vessel" type="p0:VesselNameType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Vessel name. Not applicable for trips.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="VoyageNumber" type="p0:VoyageNumberType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Voyage number. Not applicable for trips.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="RelatedVessel" type="p0:VesselNameType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Related vessel. Not applicable for trips.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="RelatedVoyageNumber" type="p0:VoyageNumberType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Related voyage number. Not applicable for trips.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="RelatedDepartureDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The related departure date and time. Not applicable
								for trips.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="RelatedDepartureDateTimeActiveFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Indicates whether RelatedDepartureDateTime is
								active. Not applicable for trips.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="RelatedDepartureShippingLocationCode" type="p0:ShippingLocationCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The related departure shipping location ID. Not
								applicable for trips.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="RelatedDepartureShippingLocationTypeEnumVal" type="p0:ShipPointEnumValType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The related departure shipping location type. Not
								applicable for trips.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="Memo" type="p0:MemoType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>A memo associated with the Trip. Optional.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="IgnoreReferenceNumbersFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Indicates whether the contents of
								referenceNumberStructure (next) should be ignored.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ReferenceNumberStructure" type="p0:ReferenceNumberType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Reference numbers attached to the trip or booking.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element></xsd:sequence></xsd:complexType><xsd:complexType name="AddLoadsToTripDataType"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Information about loads to add to a trip/booking.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation><xsd:sequence><xsd:element name="SystemTripID" type="p0:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The ID of the trip/booking.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="SystemLoadID" type="p0:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The IDs of the existing loads to be added to the
								trip/booking. At least 1 load is required. The sequence of loads
								added to the trip/booking corresponds to the sequence of Load IDs in
								the input.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element></xsd:sequence></xsd:complexType><xsd:complexType name="TripReSequenceDataType"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Information about loads to re-sequence on a trip.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation><xsd:sequence><xsd:element name="SystemTripID" type="p0:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The ID of the trip.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="SystemLoadID" type="p0:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The IDs of all existing loads of the trip. The new
								sequence of loads on the trip corresponds to the sequence of Load
								IDs in the input.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element></xsd:sequence></xsd:complexType><xsd:complexType name="ChargeCriteriaType"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The details about potential charges of a rate calculation
						request.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation><xsd:sequence><xsd:element name="CustomerOrCarrierCode" type="p0:CustomerCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The customer or carrier code. Mandatory.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ServiceCode" type="p0:ServiceCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The A/R or A/P service. Optional.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CommodityCode" type="p0:CommodityCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The commodity code. Optional.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="LoadAtCode" type="p0:ShippingLocationCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The load-at code. Optional.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="OriginHubCode" type="p0:ShippingLocationCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The origin hub code. Optional.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DestinationHubCode" type="p0:ShippingLocationCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The destination hub code. Optional.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ConsigneeCode" type="p0:ShippingLocationCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The consignee code. Optional.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element></xsd:sequence></xsd:complexType><xsd:complexType name="FreightDetailType"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The item to be rated.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation><xsd:sequence><xsd:element name="WeightByFreightClass" type="p0:WeightByFreightClassType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The freight class of the item being rated. &quot;*FAK&quot;
								indicates Freight All Kinds. Mandatory.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="Volume" type="p0:VolumeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The volume of the shipment.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="OrderValue" type="p0:DollarType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The total value of the shipment.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DeclaredValue" type="p0:DollarType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The declared value of the shipment.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="Pieces" type="p0:QuantityType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The number of pieces in the shipment. Either Pieces
								or Skids must have non-zero value if container type is not specified
								and EnableNewRateCalcFunctionFlag is true in Rate Criteria. Non-zero
								value is not allowed if container type is specified in Rate Criteria
								and EnableNewRateCalcFunctionFlag is true in Rate Criteria.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="Skids" type="p0:QuantityType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The number of skids (a.k.a. pallets) in the
								shipment. Either Pieces or Skids must have non-zero value if
								container type is not specified and EnableNewRateCalcFunctionFlag is
								true in Rate Criteria. Non-zero value is not allowed if container
								type is specified in Rate Criteria and EnableNewRateCalcFunctionFlag
								is true in Rate Criteria.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="Quantity" type="p0:QuantityType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The number of skids (a.k.a. pallets) or pieces in
								the shipment. Mandatory if container type is specified in Rate
								Criteria. Non-zero value is not allowed if container type is not
								specified in Rate Criteria. Ignored if EnableNewRateCalcFunctionFlag
								is false in Rate Criteria]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ScaledWeight" type="p0:WeightType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The scaled weight of the shipment. Non-zero value is
								not allowed if container type is specified in Rate Criteria.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="LadenLength" type="p0:DimensionType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The total laden length of the shipment.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element></xsd:sequence></xsd:complexType><xsd:complexType name="IntermediatePointType"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The intermediate location point for rate criteria used by
						rate quote request.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation><xsd:sequence><xsd:element name="StopTypeEnumVal" type="p0:StopEnumValType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The pick and drop type of the location point.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ShippingLocationTypeEnumVal" type="p0:ShipPointEnumValType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The shipping location type. If not specified and
								ShippingLocationCode is specified, one and only one shipping
								location with the specified code should exist.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ShippingLocationCode" type="p0:ShippingLocationCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The shipping location ID. Mandatory if
								EnableNewRateCalcFunctionFlag is true and RoutingMethodEnumVal is
								not RUTNGMTD_RATING in RateCriteria.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="City" type="p0:CityNameType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The city for the location point. Optional.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="State" type="p0:StateCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The state or province for the location point.
								Optional.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="PostalCode" type="p0:PostalCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The zip or postal code for the location point.
								Optional. If other address fields are present, this field is also
								mandatory if postal codes are required for the country.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="Country" type="p0:CountryCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The country for the location point. Optional.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="Latitude" type="p0:LatitudeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The latitude for the location point. Optional.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="Longitude" type="p0:LongitudeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The longitude for the location point. Optional.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element></xsd:sequence></xsd:complexType><xsd:complexType name="RateCriteriaType"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The rate criteria describe what is being shipped and the
						constraints for selecting eligible lanes. Specify the origin and destination
						shipping points by doing one of the following actions: 1) provide a shipping
						location type and shipping location code, with the shipping address implied
						OR 2) explicitly provide an address.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation><xsd:sequence><xsd:element name="ProcessARSideFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Indicates whether to find lanes for the A/R side
								rating (if True), or for the A/P side rating (if False). Mandatory.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ShipFromLocationTypeEnumVal" type="p0:ShipPointEnumValType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The origin shipping point type. If not specified and
								ShipFromLocationCode is specified, one and only one shipping
								location with the specified code should exist.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ShipFromLocationCode" type="p0:ShippingLocationCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The origin shipping location code. Mandatory if
								EnableNewRateCalcFunctionFlag is true and RoutingMethodEnumVal is
								not RUTNGMTD_RATING.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="OriginCity" type="p0:CityNameType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The origin city for the routing. Optional.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="OriginState" type="p0:StateCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The origin state or province for the routing.
								Optional.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="OriginPostalCode" type="p0:PostalCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The origin zip or postal code. Optional. If other
								origin address fields are present, this field is also mandatory if
								postal codes are required for the country.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="OriginCountry" type="p0:CountryCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The origin country. Optional.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="OriginLatitude" type="p0:LatitudeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The latitude of the origin&apos;s shipping point.
								Optional.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="OriginLongitude" type="p0:LongitudeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The longitude of the origin&apos;s shipping point.
								Optional.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ShipToLocationTypeEnumVal" type="p0:ShipPointEnumValType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The destination shipping point type. If not
								specified and ShipToLocationCode is specified, one and only one
								shipping location with the specified code should exist.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ShipToLocationCode" type="p0:ShippingLocationCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The destination shipping location code. Mandatory if
								EnableNewRateCalcFunctionFlag is true and RoutingMethodEnumVal is
								not RUTNGMTD_RATING.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DestinationCity" type="p0:CityNameType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The destination city for the routing. Optional.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DestinationState" type="p0:StateCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The destination state or province for the routing.
								Optional.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DestinationPostalCode" type="p0:PostalCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The destination zip or postal code. Optional. If
								other destination address fields are present, this field is also
								mandatory if postal codes are required for the country.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DestinationCountry" type="p0:CountryCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The destination country. Optional.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DestinationLatitude" type="p0:LatitudeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The latitude of the destination&apos;s shipping point.
								Optional.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DestinationLongitude" type="p0:LongitudeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The longitude of the destination&apos;s shipping point.
								Optional.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CustomerCode" type="p0:CustomerCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The customer that the rating is for. This is a
								required field for A/R rating. It may not be relevant for A/P rating
								if, for example, there are multiple customers for the items being
								shipped.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CarrierCode" type="p0:CarrierCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>If specified, the best lane chosen will have this
								carrier. Relevant only for A/P rating. Optional.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ServiceCode" type="p0:ServiceCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>If specified, the best lane chosen will provide this
								service. Optional.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="EquipmentTypeCode" type="p0:EquipmentCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>If specified, the best lane chosen will provide this
								equipment type. Relevant only for A/P rating. Optional.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="TractorEquipmentTypeCode" type="p0:EquipmentCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>If specified, the best lane chosen will provide this
								tractor equipment type. Relevant only for A/P rating. Optional.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DomicileCode" type="p0:DomicileCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>If specified, the best lane chosen will provide this
								tractor domicile. Relevant only for A/P rating. Optional.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DomicileTrailerCode" type="p0:DomicileCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>If specified, the best lane chosen will provide this
								trailer domicile. Relevant only for A/P rating. Optional.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="MovementStartDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The date and time when the freight movement starts.
								If specified, CumulativeDrivingTime and CumulativeBreakTime should
								be specified as well. Relevant only for A/P rating.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CumulativeDrivingHours" type="p0:HoursType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The cumulative driving time at the start of the
								freight movement. If specified, CumulativeBreakTime and
								MovementStartDateTime should be specified as well. Relevant only for
								A/P rating.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CumulativeBreakHours" type="p0:HoursType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The cumulative break time at the start of the
								freight movement. If specified, CumulativeDrivingTime and
								MovementStartDateTime should be specified as well. Relevant only for
								A/P rating.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ProjectCode" type="p0:ProjectCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The project code. This is only relevant for A/R
								rating. Its use depends upon the customer settings. Optional.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ConsigneeGroupCode" type="p0:ConsigneeGroupDomainValueType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The consignee group: only relevant for A/R rating.
								Its use depends upon the customer settings.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="UseTariffHierarchyFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Indicates whether to use the tariff hierarchy. It is
								only relevant for A/R rating.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DivisionCode" type="p0:DivisionCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The division for the rate quotation request.
								Mandatory.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CommodityCode" type="p0:CommodityCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>If specified, only lanes providing this commodity
								code are eligible for selection. Optional.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="EarliestDepartureTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[If EnableNewRateCalcFunctionFlag is true and
								RoutingMethodEnumVal is not RUTNGMTD_RATING, this is the earliest
								departure date/time for the rate quotation request and it is
								mandatory. Otherwise, if specified, rate shopping is done for the
								provided date; default value is the current date.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="LatestDepartureTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[If EnableNewRateCalcFunctionFlag is true and
								RoutingMethodEnumVal is not RUTNGMTD_RATING, this is the latest
								departure date/time for the rate quotation request and it is
								mandatory. Otherwise, it is ignored.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="EarliestArrivalTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[If EnableNewRateCalcFunctionFlag is true and
								RoutingMethodEnumVal is not RUTNGMTD_RATING, this is the earliest
								arrival date/time for the rate quotation request and it is
								mandatory. Otherwise, it is ignored.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="LatestArrivalTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[If EnableNewRateCalcFunctionFlag is true and
								RoutingMethodEnumVal is not RUTNGMTD_RATING, this is the latest
								arrival date/time for the rate quotation request and it is
								mandatory. Otherwise, it is ignored.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="SystemUnitOfMeasureEnumVal" type="p0:SystemUnitOfMeasureEnumValType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The unit of measure for the rate quotation request.
								Mandatory.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="WeightUnitOfMeasureEnumVal" type="p0:WeightUnitOfMeasureEnumValType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The weight unit of measure for the rate quotation
								request. Mandatory.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="LengthUnitOfMeasureEnumVal" type="p0:LengthUnitOfMeasureEnumValType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The length unit of measure for the rate quotation
								request. Mandatory.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="FreightDetail" type="p0:FreightDetailType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[Unit and freight class information describing the
								contents of the rate quotation request. Mandatory unless container
								level information is supplied for a rate quotation request, ignored
								if container level information is supplied for a rate quotation
								request.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ChargeOverwrite" type="p0:ChargeDetailType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>A set of charge details used for charge overwrites.
								Optional.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CurrencyCode" type="p0:CurrencyDomainValueType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The currency code for the rate quotation request,
								corresponding to a domain table currency code. Mandatory.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="NumberOfStops" type="p0:LongType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The number of additional stops for the freight.
								Optional. Cannot be a positive number if an itinerary template or
								intermediate itinerary points are specified.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="Distance" type="p0:DistanceType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The distance that the freight is being shipped.
								Optional.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="NumberOfShipments" type="p0:LongType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The number of shipments for the freight. Optional.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="EnableNewRateCalcFunctionFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[Indicates if Rate Quotation enhancement available in
								Transportation Manager Release 6.2.1 and beyond is activated. By
								default, the enhancement is not activated.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="UsePlanningTariffsFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Indicates if planning tariffs should be used. Cannot
								be set to true if ProcessARSideFlag is true or CarrierCode is not
								empty.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="RoutingMethodEnumVal" type="p0:RoutingMethodEnumValType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The routing method for rate quotation. If
								EnableNewRateCalcFunctionFlag is false, this element is ignored and
