								this element is mandatory.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CarrierServiceEquipmentRuleEnumVal" type="p0:RateQuotationCarrierServiceEquipmentEnumValType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The carrier service equipment rule. It propagates
								the carrier, service and equipment type to the first leg, last leg,
								or all legs of the rate quotation itinerary. If
								EnableNewRateCalcFunctionFlag is false or RoutingMethodEnumVal is
								not RUTNGMTD_OPTIMIZATION or ProcessARSideFlag is true, this element
								is ignored, otherwise it is mandatory.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ContainerTypeCode" type="p0:ComponentCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The container type ID. Optional. If
								EnableNewRateCalcFunctionFlag is false, this element is ignored.
								Ignored also if container level information is supplied for a rate
								quotation request. Container type group ID required for unique
								identification of a container type is retrieved from the customer
								profile if CustomerCode is specified or from Global Defaults
								otherwise.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ItineraryTemplateCode" type="p0:JourneyTemplateCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The itinerary template code. Optional. If
