								intermediate itinerary points are specified.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="OptimizerConstraintOverrideFile" type="p0:OptimizationConstraintOverrideDomainValueType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The optimizer constraint override file,
