								not RUTNGMTD_OPTIMIZATION or ProcessARSideFlag is true, this element
								is ignored.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="IntermediatePoint" type="p0:IntermediatePointType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[A set of intermediate location points for the
