								be used. Ignored if EnableNewRateCalcFunctionFlag is false.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="IgnoreContainersFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[Indicates whether the contents of
								RateQuotationContainer should be ignored. Optional. If not
