								Ignored if EnableNewRateCalcFunctionFlag is false.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="RateQuotationContainer" type="p0:RateQuotationContainerType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Container level information associated with the
								request. Ignored if EnableNewRateCalcFunctionFlag is false.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ApplyResourceConstraintsFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[Indicates whether resource constraints such as
								equipment availability and lane constraints should be applied.
								Ignored for A/R Rate Quotation.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ResourceProjectTypeCode" type="p0:ResourceProjectIDDomainValueType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The Resource Project ID. Ignored for A/R Rate
								Quotation.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="SaveResultsAsRateQuotationFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[Indicates whether to save the results of this
