								otherwise it's mandatory.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="RateQuotationDescription" type="p0:NameType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[A description of the rate quotation. If
