								type values to individual legs of the rate quotation.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CarrierServiceEquipmentRuleEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for carrierServiceEquipmentRuleEnumVal.
								Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ItineraryFormatEnumVal" type="p0:ItineraryFormatEnumValType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The input format for the itinerary of the rate
