								rate quotation.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="OptimizationConstraintOverrideFileDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for optimizationConstraintOverrideFile.
								Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ShipDirectFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Indicates whether the rate quotation is for shipping
