								equipment availability and lane constraints are applied. Not
								applicable for A/R Rate Quotation.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ResourceProjectTypeCode" type="p0:ResourceProjectIDDomainValueType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The Resource Project ID. Not applicable for A/R Rate
