								quotation.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element></xsd:sequence></xsd:complexType><xsd:complexType name="RateQuotationContainerType"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[Container information for a Rate Quotation request. The
						Summarized Entry Mode flag for the applicable Shipment Version will control
						whether weight, volume, order value, declared value and laden length for
						each occurrence of the container structure should be interpreted as being an
						extended value (Summarized Entry Mode is True) or a per-container value
						(False). When False, the value specified for the container must be extended
						by the Quantity to establish the extended value. The Shipment Version
						required to derive the value for Summarized Entry Mode flag is retrieved
						from the customer profile if CustomerCode is specified in RateCriteria or
						from Global Defaults otherwise.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation><xsd:sequence><xsd:element name="ContainerTypeCode" type="p0:ComponentCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The container type ID. Mandatory. Container type
								group ID required for unique identification of a container type is
								retrieved from the customer profile if CustomerCode is specified in
								RateCriteria or from Global Defaults otherwise.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="Quantity" type="p0:QuantityType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The number of skids (a.k.a. pallets) or pieces in
