								container. "*FAK" indicates Freight All Kinds. Mandatory. Currently,
								only one entry per container is allowed. Mode of input depends on
								Summarized Entry Mode flag.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="Volume" type="p0:VolumeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The volume of the container. If volume is not
