								been specified, volume will be derived from the volume for the
								container type identified by ContainerTypeCode. If volume is not
								specified and at least one of the dimensions have been specified,
								volume will be calculated from dimensions, some of the dimensions
								might be derived from the container type; in this case, when at
								least one of the dimension still has zero value, volume will be
								derived from the volume for the container type. Mode of input
