								Statuses.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CurrentTripFinancialStatusEnumVal" type="p0:TripFinancialStatusEnumValType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>List of Financial Statuses for bookings. If
								specified, bookings will be filtered with the list of Financial
								Statuses.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="OriginCountry" type="p0:CountryCodeType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[List of Origin Countries. If specified, bookings
								will be filtered with the list of Origin Countries. Wild card
								character % is allowed. Comma should not be entered here, it will be
								treated as field separator and may result in syntax error.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="OriginState" type="p0:StateCodeType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[List of Origin States. If specified, bookings will
								be filtered with the list of Origin States. Wild card character % is
								allowed. Comma should not be entered here, it will be treated as
								field separator and may result in syntax error.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="OriginCity" type="p0:CityNameType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[List of Origin Cities. If specified, bookings will
								be filtered with the list of Origin Cities. Wild card character % is
								allowed. Comma should not be entered here, it will be treated as
								field separator and may result in syntax error.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DestinationCountry" type="p0:CountryCodeType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[List of Destination Countries. If specified,
								bookings will be filtered with the list of Destination Countries.
								Wild card character % is allowed. Comma should not be entered here,
								it will be treated as field separator and may result in syntax
								error.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DestinationState" type="p0:StateCodeType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[List of Destination States. If specified, bookings
								will be filtered with the list of Destination States. Wild card
								character % is allowed. Comma should not be entered here, it will be
								treated as field separator and may result in syntax error.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DestinationCity" type="p0:CityNameType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[List of Destination Cities. If specified, bookings
								will be filtered with the list of Destination Cities. Wild card
								character % is allowed. Comma should not be entered here, it will be
								treated as field separator and may result in syntax error.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="OriginShippingLocation" type="p0:StopShippingLocationType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[List of First Stop Shipping Locations. Not returned
								by UI-oriented APIs if the optimization request is created by
								Transportation Manager Web UI, please see
								OriginShippingLocationTypeEnumVal and OriginShippingLocationCode.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DestinationShippingLocation" type="p0:StopShippingLocationType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[List of Last Stop Shipping Locations. Not returned
								by UI-oriented APIs if the optimization request is created by
								Transportation Manager Web UI, please see
								DestinationShippingLocationTypeEnumVal and
								DestinationShippingLocationCode.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="OriginShippingLocationTypeEnumVal" type="p0:ShipPointEnumValType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[List of the First Stop Shipping Location types. Used
								only by UI-oriented APIs for optimization requests created by
								Transportation Manager Web UI. This field is ignored for creation of
								optimization requests, please use OriginShippingLocation.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="OriginShippingLocationCode" type="p0:ShippingLocationCodeType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[List of the First Stop Shipping Location codes. Used
								only by UI-oriented APIs for optimization requests created by
								Transportation Manager Web UI. This field is ignored for creation of
								optimization requests, please use OriginShippingLocation.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DestinationShippingLocationTypeEnumVal" type="p0:ShipPointEnumValType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[List of the Last Stop Shipping Location types. Used
								only by UI-oriented APIs for optimization requests created by
								Transportation Manager Web UI. This field is ignored for creation of
								optimization requests, please use DestinationShippingLocation.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DestinationShippingLocationCode" type="p0:ShippingLocationCodeType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[List of the Last Stop Shipping Location codes. Used
								only by UI-oriented APIs for optimization requests created by
								Transportation Manager Web UI. This field is ignored for creation of
								optimization requests, please use DestinationShippingLocation.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="Vessel" type="p0:VesselNameType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[List of Vessel Names for bookings. If specified,
								bookings will be filtered with the list of Vessel Names. Wild card
								character % is allowed. Comma should not be entered here, it will be
								treated as field separator and may result in syntax error.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="VoyageNumber" type="p0:VoyageNumberType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[List of Voyage Numbers for bookings. If specified,
								bookings will be filtered with the list of Voyage Numbers. Wild card
								character % is allowed. Comma should not be entered here, it will be
								treated as field separator and may result in syntax error.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DepartureShippingLocation" type="p0:StopShippingLocationType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[List of Vessel Departure Shipping Locations. Not
								returned by UI-oriented APIs if the optimization request is created
								by Transportation Manager Web UI, please see
								DepartureShippingLocationTypeEnumVal and
								DepartureShippingLocationCode.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ArrivalShippingLocation" type="p0:StopShippingLocationType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[List of Vessel Arrival Shipping Locations. Not
								returned by UI-oriented APIs if the optimization request is created
								by Transportation Manager Web UI, please see
								ArrivalShippingLocationTypeEnumVal and ArrivalShippingLocationCode.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DepartureShippingLocationTypeEnumVal" type="p0:ShipPointEnumValType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[List of the Vessel Departure Shipping Location
								types. Used only by UI-oriented APIs for optimization requests
								created by Transportation Manager Web UI. This field is ignored for
								creation of optimization requests, please use
								DepartureShippingLocation.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DepartureShippingLocationCode" type="p0:ShippingLocationCodeType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[List of the Vessel Departure Shipping Location
								codes. Used only by UI-oriented APIs for optimization requests
								created by Transportation Manager Web UI. This field is ignored for
								creation of optimization requests, please use
								DepartureShippingLocation.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ArrivalShippingLocationTypeEnumVal" type="p0:ShipPointEnumValType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[List of the Vessel Arrival Shipping Location types.
								Used only by UI-oriented APIs for optimization requests created by
								Transportation Manager Web UI. This field is ignored for creation of
								optimization requests, please use ArrivalShippingLocation.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ArrivalShippingLocationCode" type="p0:ShippingLocationCodeType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[List of the Vessel Arrival Shipping Location codes.
								Used only by UI-oriented APIs for optimization requests created by
								Transportation Manager Web UI. This field is ignored for creation of
								optimization requests, please use ArrivalShippingLocation.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ResourceProjectTypeCode" type="p0:ResourceProjectIDDomainValueType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[List of Resource Project IDs. If specified, booking
								loads will be filtered with the list of Resource Project IDs. Empty
								elements are ignored, please provide a double-quoted space (" ") for
								the default Resource Project ID.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element></xsd:sequence></xsd:complexType><xsd:complexType name="CompTrackingNumberType"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>A container (formerly called component) tracking number
						override used in shipment confirmation.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation><xsd:sequence><xsd:element name="ReferenceNumberTypeCode" type="p0:ReferenceNumDomainValueType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The reference number type identifying the container
								(formerly called component) to which the tracking number is applied.
								This must be "API". Required for all operations. If the value
								entered is not "API", it will still be treated as "API".]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ReferenceNumber" type="p0:ExternalXRefType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The reference number identifying the container
								(formerly called component) to be applied. Required for all
								operations. For container with quantity greater than one, the number
								of API container reference number can be one or greater than one.
								For example, if the quantity of the container is three, then the API
								container reference numbers can be: case 1: CON-REF1 case 2:
								CON-REF1 and CON-REF2 case 3: CON-REF1, CON-REF3 and CON-REF3]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="TrackingNumber" type="p0:ExternalXRefType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The overriding tracking number for the specified
								container (formerly called) component. Required for all operations.
								Possible cases for the quantity field of the container greater than
								one, let say three, could be: case 1: type API, reference number
								CON-REF1, tracking number CON-TRACK1 type API, reference number
								CON-REF1, tracking number CON-TRACK2 type API, reference number
								CON-REF1, tracking number CON-TRACK3 case 2: type API, reference
								number CON-REF1, tracking number CON-TRACK1 type API, reference
								number CON-REF2, tracking number CON-TRACK2 type API, reference
								number CON-REF2, tracking number CON-TRACK3 case 3: type API,
								reference number CON-REF1, tracking number CON-TRACK1 type API,
								reference number CON-REF2, tracking number CON-TRACK2 type API,
								reference number CON-REF3, tracking number CON-TRACK3]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element></xsd:sequence></xsd:complexType><xsd:complexType name="ComponentReferenceNumberType"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>A reference number of a Container (formerly called
						Component).</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation><xsd:sequence><xsd:element name="Id" type="p0:IDType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Internal ID. Applicable only for UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="Item" type="xsd:integer" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Always returned as zero.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ReferenceNumberTypeCode" type="p0:ReferenceNumDomainValueType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>A domain table value that indicates the reference
								number qualifier type for this reference number.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ReferenceNumberTypeCodeDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for referenceNumberTypeCode. Read-only.
								Available only through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ReferenceNumber" type="p0:ExternalXRefType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The value of the reference number or code.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element></xsd:sequence></xsd:complexType><xsd:complexType name="ContainerType"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[A single detail (Container or Item Summary) within a
						shipment which is used to store items. A container has attributes such as
						weight, length, width, height, and volume.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation><xsd:sequence><xsd:element name="Id" type="p0:IDType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Internal ID. Applicable only for UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="SystemContainerID" type="p0:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The system-generated shipment detail ID. This is a
								read-only field except for Update and Delete options of the
								container maintenance operation where it is mandatory.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ContainerTypeCode" type="p0:ComponentCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The container type. Ignored if shipment entry mode
								is Item Summary Level, otherwise mandatory for a new or recreated
								Container and cannot be blank.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="Quantity" type="p0:QuantityNullableType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The number of identical shipment details. Mandatory
								for a new Container. Cannot be blank.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="Length" type="p0:DimensionType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The length of the shipment detail. If NULL, then the
								default value for a container is based on the component type that
								containerTypeCode specifies.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="Width" type="p0:DimensionType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The width of the shipment detail. If NULL, then the
								default value for a container is based on the component type that
								containerTypeCode specifies.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="Height" type="p0:DimensionType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The height of the shipment detail. If NULL, then the
								default value for a container is based on the component type that
								containerTypeCode specifies.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ContainerShippingInformation" type="p0:ShippingInformationType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The shipping information structure.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ContainerDescription" type="p0:NameType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>A description of this shipment detail.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="StackCode" type="p0:UnsignedLongType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The stacking mode ID.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="StackFactor" type="p0:UnsignedLongType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The stacking factor: the amount of weight that can
								be stacked on top of this shipment detail.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="StackGroup" type="p0:UnsignedLongType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The stacking group: indicates the relative
								durability of this shipment detail.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="NestingDimensionEnumVal" type="p0:ControlDimensionEnumValType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The container dimension along which the nesting
								occurs. if no value is assigned, then nesting is not allowed.
								Currently not in use.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="NestingDimensionEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for NestingDimensionEnumVal. Read-only.
								Available only through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="NestingValue" type="p0:DimensionType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The nesting value: the increase along the nesting
								dimension with each additional nested unit. if no value is assigned,
								then nesting is not allowed. Currently not in use.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="MaximumNestingSize" type="p0:UnsignedShortType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The maximum number of allowed nested units. If no
								value is assigned, then nesting is not allowed. Currently not in
								use.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="Occurence" type="p0:UnsignedLongType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The shipment detail occurrence. Used as a factor
								when calculating the total scaled weight, volume, order value, and
								declared value for the shipment having this container. It is equal
								to 1 when the summarized entry mode is false, and equal to the
								container quantity when the summarized entry mode is true. This is a
								read-only field.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="LoadConfiguratorContainerTypeCode" type="p0:UnsignedShortType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The load configuration container type. This is a
								read-only field. This element is not in use.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="RatingUnitEnumVal" type="p0:UnitEnumValType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The rating unit type. This is a read-only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="RatingUnitEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for RatingUnitEnumVal. Read-only.
								Available only through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="MaximumScaledWeight" type="p0:WeightType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The maximum scaled weight. This is a read-only
								field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ShipmentContainerNumber" type="p0:ExternalXRefType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The shipment container number.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ShipmentContainerCrossReference" type="p0:ExternalXRefType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The cross-reference of the shipment container.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ContainerGLCategory" type="p0:UnsignedShortType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The G/L category for items for this container. This
								is a read-only field. Currently not in use.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="InputSourceEnumVal" type="p0:TransactionSourceEnumValType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The source of data input, such as API, EDI or
								through the GUI. This is a read-only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="InputSourceEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for InputSourceEnumVal. Read-only.
								Available only through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="MarkedForLocationEnumVal" type="p0:ShipPointEnumValType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>A location to which the container is taken after the
								shipment is delivered. Currently not in use.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="MarkedForLocationEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for MarkedForLocationEnumVal. Read-only.
								Available only through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="MarkedForLocationCode" type="p0:ShippingLocationCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The ID for the location to which the container is
								taken after the shipment is delivered. Currently not in use.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DisplayColor" type="p0:DisplayColorType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>A display color for item summary. Ignored if
								Shipment Entry Mode is not Item Summary Level.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DisplayName" type="p0:NameType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>A display name for item summary. Ignored if Shipment
								Entry Mode is not Item Summary Level.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="StackingRuleEnumVal" type="p0:StackingRuleEnumValType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The stacking rule. Ignored if Load Configurator is
								not enabled in Global Defaults.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="StackingRuleEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for StackingRuleEnumVal. Read-only.
								Available only through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CarrierPackageType" type="p0:CarrierPackageDomainValueType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The carrier packaging type. Ignored if Shipment
								Entry Mode is not Item Summary Level.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CarrierPackageTypeDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for CarrierPackageType. Read-only.
								Available only through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CarrierPackageRegion" type="p0:CarrierPackageRegionType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The carrier packaging region. Ignored if Shipment
								Entry Mode is not Item Summary Level.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="SplitMethodEnumVal" type="p0:SplitMethodEnumValType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The split method. Ignored if Shipment Entry Mode is
								Item Detail Level or split method of the shipment is not Shipment
								Detail Level.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="SplitMethodEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for SplitMethodEnumVal. Read-only.
								Available only through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="LoadConfiguratorContainerTypeEnumVal" type="p0:LoadConfiguratorContainerTypeEnumValType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The Load Configurator container type. Ignored if
								Load Configurator is not enabled in Global Defaults.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="LoadConfiguratorContainerTypeEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for
								LoadConfiguratorContainerTypeEnumVal. Read-only. Available only
								through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ItemNumber" type="p0:ItemNumberCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The Item Master ID. Ignored if Shipment Entry Mode
								is not Item Summary Level, otherwise mandatory for a new or
								recreated shipment detail and cannot be blank.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ItemGroupCode" type="p0:ItemGroupCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The Item Group ID. This field is read-only.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ItemPackageLevelIDCode" type="p0:ItemPackageLevelIDTypeDomainValueType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The item package level type ID. Ignored if Shipment
								Entry Mode is not Item Summary Level. System-defined values are
								'100' for 'Pallets', '200' for 'Layers' and '300' for 'Pieces'.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ItemPackageLevelIDCodeDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for ItemPackageLevelIDCode. Read-only.
								Available only through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ItemDescription" type="p0:ItemDescriptionType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The item description. Ignored if Shipment Entry Mode
								is not Item Summary Level, otherwise cannot be blank.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="NumberOfUnits" type="p0:QuantityType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The number of units. Ignored if Shipment Entry Mode
								is not Item Summary Level.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="Is3DLoadingRequiredFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Indicates whether 3D loading is required. Ignored if
								Load Configurator is not enabled in Global Defaults.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ItemType" type="p0:ItemDomainValueType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The item type. Ignored if Shipment Entry Mode is not
								Item Summary Level.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ItemTypeDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for ItemType. Read-only. Available only
								through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ContentLevelTypeCode" type="p0:ItemPackageLevelIDTypeDomainValueType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The content level type. Ignored if Shipment Entry
								Mode is not Item Summary Level. System-defined values are '100' for
								'Pallets', '200' for 'Layers' and '300' for 'Pieces'.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ContentLevelTypeCodeDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for ContentLevelTypeCode. Read-only.
								Available only through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="Priority" type="p0:UnsignedShortType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Priority: the lower the number, the higher the
								priority. Ignored if Shipment Entry Mode is not Item Summary Level.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ItemPackagingCommittedFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Indicates whether item packaging is committed.
								Ignored if Shipment Entry Mode is not Item Summary Level.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="OriginCountryCode" type="p0:CountryCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The country of origin. Ignored if Shipment Entry
								Mode is not Item Summary Level.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="IgnoreContainerOrientationsFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[Indicates whether the contents of
								ContainerOrientation should be ignored. Used only for Update option
								of the container maintenance operation, otherwise assumed to be
								false regardless of the input.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ContainerOrientation" type="p0:ContainerOrientationType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The container orientation objects attached to the
								shipment detail. Presence depends on the value of
								IgnoreContainerOrientationsFlag.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="IgnoreWeightByFreightClassFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[Indicates whether the contents of
								WeightByFreightClass should be ignored. Used only for Update option
								of the shipment detail maintenance operation, otherwise assumed to
