								field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CreatedByUserCode" type="p0:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The ID of the user who created the Lane. This is a
								read-only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="UpdatedByUserCode" type="p0:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The ID of the user who updated the Lane. This is a
								read-only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CreatedDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The date and time that the Lane was created. This is
								a read-only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="UpdatedDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The date and time that the Lane was updated. This is
								a read-only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="RestrictionExistFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Indicates whether there are Restriction data.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="Restriction" type="p0:RestrictionType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The restriction data for the Lane. Optional.
								Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="LaneTemplateCode" type="p0:LaneTemplateCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The Lane Template code. Optional for creation of a
								Lane, ignored for modification of a Lane.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="NumberOfStops" type="p0:UnsignedShortType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The number of itinerary points in the Lane Template.
								This is a read-only element.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CarrierPerformanceEnabledFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[Indicates whether the Carrier Performance is
								enabled. Optional. Conditional Updatable. It can be updated when the
								tariff is a referential tariff and not a customer specific tariff.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ServiceGradeCode" type="p0:ShortType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The grade for the service provided by the carrier.
								It is also called Carrier Performance. Its value can be set only
								when the Carrier Performance Enabled flag is set.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="OptimizationControlEnumVal" type="p0:OptimizationControlEnumValType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[Indicates if the lane will be excluded from
