								the tariff service level. Can be an empty element. Updatable.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="OptimizationControlEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for optimizationControlEnumVal.
								Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="FreightAuctionEligibilityEnumVal" type="p0:FreightAuctionEligibilityEnumValType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Type of freight auction eligibility. Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="FreightAuctionEligibilityEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for FreightAuctionEligibilityEnumVal.
								Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DockSelectionConstraintDefinedFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Indicates whether any dock selection constraint is
								defined for this tariff lane. Read only.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="IgnoreDockSelectionConstraintFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[Indicates whether the contents of
