								Optional. May be present for add and change operations.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DockSelectionConstraint" type="p0:DockSelectionConstraintType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The dock selection constraint entries associated
								with this tariff lane.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element></xsd:sequence></xsd:complexType><xsd:complexType name="LaneTemplateType"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>An itinerary, or an ordered list of intermediate points
						(stops) for a Lane.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation><xsd:sequence><xsd:element name="Id" type="p0:IDType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Internal ID. Applicable only for UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="LaneTemplateCode" type="p0:LaneTemplateCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The Lane Template code. Mandatory for a new Lane
								Template. Used to identify an existing one.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="LaneTemplateDescription" type="p0:NameType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The Lane Template description. Mandatory for a new
								Lane Template. May be changed for an existing Lane Template.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="NumberOfStops" type="p0:UnsignedShortType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The number of itinerary points in the Lane Template.
								This is a read-only element.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DivisionCode" type="p0:DivisionCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The Division that the Lane Template is restricted
								to. The Lane Template may only be used on a Lane that is restricted
