								changed for an existing Lane Template.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="IgnoreLaneThroughPoints" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Indicates whether the contents of laneThroughPoint
								should be ignored. May be present for add and change operations.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="LaneThroughPoint" type="p0:LaneThroughPointType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Intermediate point (stop) used to define a Lane.
								Mandatory. Repeatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CreatedByUserCode" type="p0:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The ID of the user who created the Lane Template.
								This is a read-only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="UpdatedByUserCode" type="p0:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The ID of the user who last updated the Lane
