								update (change) operation, LaneThroughPoints with a matching ID will
								be modified; new LaneThroughPoints will be created for those without
								a laneThroughPointID element, and any remaining LaneThroughPoints
								will be deleted.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ItineraryPointSequenceNumber" type="p0:UnsignedShortType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Represents the order of this through point in the
								itinerary. This is a read-only element.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ShippingLocationCode" type="p0:ShippingLocationCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The shipping location point code. The shipping
