								Mandatory for a new Lane Template. May be changed for an existing
								Lane Template.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ShippingLocationTypeEnumVal" type="p0:ShipPointEnumValType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The shipping location point type. Qualifies the
