								Template. If not supplied for a new or re-created lane through
								point, one and only one shipping location with the specified code
								should exist.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ShippingLocationTypeEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for shippingLocationTypeEnumVal.
								Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CreatedDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The date and time when the entry was created. This
								is a read-only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="UpdatedDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The date and time when the entry was updated. This
								is a read-only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CreatedByUserCode" type="p0:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The ID of the user who created the entry. This is a
								read-only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="UpdatedByUserCode" type="p0:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The ID of the user who updated the entry. This is a
								read-only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element></xsd:sequence></xsd:complexType><xsd:complexType name="MasterChargeType"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>A master charge (condition or option).</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation><xsd:sequence><xsd:element name="Id" type="p0:IDType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Internal ID. Applicable only for UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ChargeCode" type="p0:ChargeCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The master charge code. Cannot be changed for an
