								deletion of a Master Charge.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ChargeDescription" type="p0:NameType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>A description of the charge. Mandatory for a new
								Master Charge. Cannot be an empty element. Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ConditionFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Indicates whether the master charge is a condition
