								Available only through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="LookupUnitsEnumVal" type="p0:UnitEnumValType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The lookup unit type. Updatable. UT_CLEAR should be
								used to update the value to UT_NULL (empty).</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="LookupUnitsEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for lookupUnitsEnumVal. Read-only.
								Available only through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="MultiFreightClassFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Indicates whether the master charge supports
								multiple freight classes. Cannot be changed for an existing Master
								Charge.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ConditionIsTaxFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Indicates whether the master charge represents a
								tax. Cannot be changed for an existing Master Charge.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="GLTypeCode" type="p0:GLDomainValueType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The G/L type. Mandatory. Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="GLTypeCodeDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for GLTypeCode. Read-only. Available
								only through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DataAccumulationLevelEnumVal" type="p0:DataAccumulationLevelEnumValType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The data accumulation level. Mandatory. Cannot be
								changed for an existing Master Charge.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DataAccumulationLevelEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for dataAccumulationLevelEnumVal.
								Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ExternalCode1" type="p0:ExternalXRefType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The first external code. Optional. Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ExternalCode2" type="p0:ExternalXRefType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The second external code. Optional. Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="FuelSurchargeChargeFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Indicates whether the master charge is a fuel
								surcharge. Cannot be changed for an existing Master Charge.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="EquipmentSpecificChargeFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[Indicates whether the master charge is an
