								Master Charge.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="EquipmentCategoryEnumVal" type="p0:EquipmentCategorySubset1EnumValType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The tractor or trailer equipment category. Cannot be
								changed for an existing Master Charge. Cannot have a non-null value
								if EquipmentSpecificChargeFlag is false.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="EquipmentCategoryEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for EquipmentCategoryEnumVal. Read-only.
								Available only through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ChargeDetailPresentationEnumVal" type="p0:ChargeDetailPresentationEnumValType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Type of presentation (font color) for charge
								details. Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ChargeDetailPresentationEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for ChargeDetailPresentationEnumVal.
								Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="OptionUtilizationEnumVal" type="p0:OptionUtilizationEnumValType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Option Utilization. Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="OptionUtilizationEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for optionUtilizationEnumVal. Read-only.
								Available only through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="DuplicateEnabledFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Indicates whether charge overrides of a shipment can
								be duplicated. Cannot be changed for an existing Master Charge.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CreatedDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The date and time that the Master Charge was
								created. This is a read-only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="UpdatedDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The date and time that the Master Charge was
								updated. This is a read-only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CreatedByUserCode" type="p0:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The ID of the user who created the Master Charge.
								This is a read-only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="UpdatedByUserCode" type="p0:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The ID of the user who updated the Master Charge.
								This is a read-only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element></xsd:sequence></xsd:complexType><xsd:complexType name="RangeBreakType"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>A range break.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation><xsd:sequence><xsd:element name="Id" type="p0:IDType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Internal ID. Applicable only for UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="RangeCode" type="p0:RangeCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The range code to which the range break belongs.
								This is a read-only field, ignored for input.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="RangeToUnits" type="p0:NumberofUnitsType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The upper limit for a Range Break. Mandatory. Not
								updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ChargeTypeEnumVal" type="p0:ChargeTypeEnumValType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The charge type. Mandatory. Not updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ChargeTypeEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Description for chargeTypeEnumVal. Read-only.
								Available only through UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ClipFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Indicates whether clipping is applied. Not
								updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element></xsd:sequence></xsd:complexType><xsd:complexType name="RangeType"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>A range.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation><xsd:sequence><xsd:element name="Id" type="p0:IDType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Internal ID. Applicable only for UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="RangeCode" type="p0:RangeCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The range code. Mandatory. Not updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="RangeDescription" type="p0:NameType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>A description of the Range. Mandatory for a new
								Range. Cannot be blank. Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CreatedByUserCode" type="p0:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The ID of the user who created the Range. This is a
								read-only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="UpdatedByUserCode" type="p0:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The ID of the user who updated the Range. This is a
								read-only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="CreatedDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The date and time that the Range was created. This
								is a read-only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="UpdatedDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The date and time that the Range was updated. This
								is a read-only field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="IgnoreBreaksFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Indicates whether the contents of Break should be
								ignored. May be present for add and change operations.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="Break" type="p0:RangeBreakType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The range breaks of the Range.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element></xsd:sequence></xsd:complexType><xsd:complexType name="RateType"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>A Tariff Rate.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation><xsd:sequence><xsd:element name="Id" type="p0:IDType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Internal ID. Applicable only for UI-oriented APIs.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="SystemRateID" type="p0:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The system generated numerical Rate ID. Cannot be
								changed for an existing Rate. Mandatory for modification/deletion of
								a Rate if the business key which is a combination of
								tariffID/rateCode/tariffServiceCode/tariffChargeCode/freightClassCode/(conditionally)equipmentTypeCode/(conditionally)effectiveDate/(conditionally)/expirationDate
								is not provided. Ignored for rate creation. Not applicable for
								processTariffRate operation.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="TariffID" type="p0:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The tariff ID. Part of the business key. Cannot be
								changed for an existing Rate. Mandatory for rate creation unless the
								data are used to create new tariff.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="RateCode" type="p0:RateCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The Rate Code. Part of the business key. Cannot be
								changed for an existing Rate, newRateCode should be used for this
								purpose.. Mandatory for creation of a Rate.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="TariffServiceCode" type="p0:ServiceCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The Tariff Service code. Part of the business key.
								Cannot be changed for an existing Rate. Mandatory for creation of a
								Rate.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="TariffChargeCode" type="p0:ChargeCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The Tariff Charge code. Part of the business key.
								Cannot be changed for an existing Rate. Mandatory for creation of a
								Rate.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="FreightClassCode" type="p0:FreightClassCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The Freight Class code. Part of the business key.
								Cannot be changed for an existing Rate. Mandatory for creation of a
								Rate.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="EquipmentTypeCode" type="p0:EquipmentCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The Equipment Type code. Part of the business key if
								the Tariff Charge is enabled for Equipment Types. Cannot be
								specified if the Tariff Charge is not enabled for Equipment Types.
								Cannot be changed for an existing Rate. Mandatory for creation of a
								Rate if the Tariff Charge is enabled for Equipment Types.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="RateForShipmentFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>Indicates whether the rate is applied at Shipment
								level. Optional. Reserved for future development, currently always
								set to false.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="BaseChargeAmount" type="p0:DollarWithNegativeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The base charge. Optional. Cannot be an empty
								element. Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="MinimumChargeAmount" type="p0:DollarWithNegativeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The minimum charge. Optional. Cannot be an empty
								element. Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="MaximumChargeAmount" type="p0:DollarWithNegativeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The maximum charge. Optional. Cannot be an empty
								element. Updatable.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="NumberOfRateRanges" type="p0:UnsignedShortType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>The number of Rate Ranges. This is a read-only
								field.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="EffectiveDate" type="xsd:date" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The Effective Date. Part of the business key if the
								Tariff Charge is enabled for Rates by Date. Cannot be specified if
								the Tariff Charge is not enabled for Rates by Date. Cannot be
								changed for an existing Rate, newEffectiveDate should be used for
								this purpose. Mandatory for creation of a Rate if the Tariff Charge
								is enabled for Rates by Date. Cannot be an empty element.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="ExpirationDate" type="xsd:date" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The Expiration Date. Part of the business key if the
								Tariff Charge is enabled for Rates by Date. Cannot be specified if
								the Tariff Charge is not enabled for Rates by Date. Cannot be
								changed for an existing Rate, newExpirationDate should be used for
								this purpose. Mandatory for creation of a Rate if the Tariff Charge
								is enabled for Rates by Date. Cannot be an empty element.]]></xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation></xsd:element><xsd:element name="NewRateCode" type="p0:RateCodeType" minOccurs="0"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation><![CDATA[The new Rate Code for an existing Rate (change
								operation only). Optional. If the new Rate Code does not exist, it
								will be created and rateCodeDescription is mandatory. Cannot be
								blank. Not applicable for rate creation. Not applicable if a Rate is
